WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:05,080
Electrical return, no fighting, no one-day tour of the fifth level loss circle

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,080
Funny

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,180
But what if it's true?

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:12,440
It’s early to get the boss job

5
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,440
Girl, come on, get me a card quickly

6
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:17,440
This kid didn't tell his dad in advance that he would make a fool of himself.

7
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:20,440
Top-up successful, 100g points have been deposited

8
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:23,440
Boss, I have a card this time. Can I get in?

9
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:30,030
If you dare to offend me, I will have a big meal and then not pay the bill

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:33,030
Dad, didn't you say you wanted to take over this hotel?

11
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:38,960
Who are you looking down on?

12
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:41,960
When I become the boss here, I will be the first to kick these two bastards out.

13
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:46,280
Dad, you really plan to take over the hotel and give it to me, the big boss of the base.

14
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,280
Eat more, you are not allowed to eat today

15
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,280
Just this meal
